{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_05_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_05","title":"各抒己見","storyCode":"GT-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"1964ebdcfd591fa26fd41afaee036a758ecad5569711f6710e0bc53b08ecc12a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你這個礙事的混蛋小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"都、都頭破血流成這樣了，還敢在這擋我們的好事——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"區區這點傷，連日常訓練都算不上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，記不清了，反正已經全都擋住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"發、發生地震了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？那邊的山岩怎麼崩塌了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"騙人的吧？她居然打破了那麼厚的石壁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"入口被打開了一條新的路！趕緊進去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，那些人一定會從斯卡蒂打出的通道湧進來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"得趕快去幫可——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"居然能直接破壞山體，強行穿過去，羅德島的異聞果然是真的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"盯上那東西的人不止我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我非要把你好好教訓一頓，你才不會礙事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你突然就要帶走可蘿爾，我怎麼也不能輕易把她交給你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你要......阻礙羅德島的任務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你也沒告訴我羅德島給你分配了什麼任務啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不要突然攻擊同伴啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"誰是你的同伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我最後一次問，帶我去見那個女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"只要她還是我的委託人，我就絕不會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，她只是用劍隨手碰了下我的槍而已啊，可我的胳膊好像要斷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"只憑你這種能力，你真的認為自己保護得了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能做到，和去不去做是兩回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？先等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，這下總該打中了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好像有，不對，好像沒有！那傢伙還好好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......又來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"災、災星！把上尉打傷的，就是你吧！你今天就別想從這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好機會，趁現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別想過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還是想想辦法先攔住她吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況？！那個小個子，從我們頭上跳過去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，我先走一步了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思！等你想清楚，準備告訴我事實了，我再考慮可蘿爾的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"站住，你去哪裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼就放她走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"她跑得太快了，我們追不上她啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，這不是還有一個嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你個子那麼大，不可能也跳過去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們完蛋了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"岔路好多啊。這裡就是可蘿爾所說的墓穴了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，賞金獵人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......救命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"太慘了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"就像是被羅德島號來回碾壓過好幾遍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可斯卡蒂不是還沒進來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這個看上去像炸開的洞是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經想明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪裡演得不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然是————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
